1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
If you give a mushroom robot legs,

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,390
it can actually walk.

3
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:05,015
Scientists grew living fungus

4
00:00:05,055 --> 00:00:06,650
into a robot's electronics.

5
00:00:06,690 --> 00:00:08,070
And every time the fungus fired

6
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:09,470
an electrical signal...

7
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:10,730
The robot moved.

8
00:00:10,770 --> 00:00:12,380
But here's where it gets weird.

9
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:14,700
They shined ultraviolet light on the fungus.

10
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:16,520
And the robot changed how it walked.

11
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:18,540
So this thing has no brain.

12
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:19,350
No eyes.

13
00:00:19,390 --> 00:00:20,900
And absolutely no idea

14
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:21,860
where it's going.

15
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,325
But the mushroom is literally

16
00:00:23,365 --> 00:00:24,740
controlling its legs.

17
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,325
Which means scientists basically

18
00:00:26,365 --> 00:00:28,070
gave a fungus a body.

